<script setup lang="ts">
import {ref,onMounted,onBeforeUnmount} from 'vue'
const days=ref(30),data=ref<any>(),busy=ref(false),error=ref('');let active:AbortController|undefined
const names:Record<string,string>={REAL:'真实 BYOK 派发',MOCK:'Mock 派发',UNCONFIRMED:'来源未确认'}
const num=(v:unknown)=>typeof v==='number'?v.toLocaleString('zh-CN'):'未知'
async function refresh(){active?.abort();const c=new AbortController();active=c;busy.value=true;error.value=''
 try{const r=await fetch('/api/admin/ai-usage?days='+days.value,{credentials:'same-origin',signal:AbortSignal.any([c.signal,AbortSignal.timeout(20000)])});if(!r.ok)throw new Error(r.status===401?'登录已失效，请重新登录。':r.status===403?'需要管理员权限。':'用量账本暂时无法读取，请重试。');const body=await r.json();if(active===c)data.value=body.data}
 catch(e){if(!c.signal.aborted)error.value=(e as Error).message}finally{if(active===c)busy.value=false}}
onMounted(refresh);onBeforeUnmount(()=>active?.abort());defineExpose({refresh})
</script>
<template><section class="ai-report" aria-labelledby="ai-analysis-title">
 <header><h2 id="ai-analysis-title">AI 服务分析</h2><div><label for="ai-window">统计窗口</label><select id="ai-window" v-model="days" @change="refresh"><option :value="7">近 7 天</option><option :value="30">近 30 天</option><option :value="90">近 90 天</option></select><button :disabled="busy" @click="refresh">刷新用量</button></div></header>
 <p v-if="error" role="alert" class="error">{{error}}</p><p v-if="busy" role="status">正在读取现有用量账本…</p>
 <template v-if="data&&!busy&&!error"><p v-if="data.status!=='AVAILABLE'" role="status">AI 用量账本不可用，暂不展示统计值。</p><template v-else>
 <p>按 UTC 服务端派发时间统计。已知 Token 合计 <strong>{{num(data.known_total_tokens)}}</strong>；用量不完整 {{num(data.unknown_calls)}} 次；未派发 {{num(data.not_dispatched_calls)}} 次（不计入调用和 Token）。</p>
 <div class="report-table"><table><caption>按调用来源统计 Token 用量</caption><thead><tr><th>来源</th><th>派发次数</th><th>已知输入</th><th>已知输出</th><th>已知合计</th><th>已知缓存命中输入</th><th>用量不完整</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="g in data.groups" :key="g.provenance"><th>{{names[g.provenance]}}</th><td>{{num(g.calls)}}</td><td>{{num(g.known_input_tokens)}}<small>{{g.input_reported_calls}} / {{g.calls}} 次已报告</small></td><td>{{num(g.known_output_tokens)}}<small>{{g.output_reported_calls}} / {{g.calls}} 次已报告</small></td><td>{{num(g.known_total_tokens)}}</td><td>{{num(g.known_cached_input_tokens)}}<small>{{g.cached_input_reported_calls}} / {{g.calls}} 次已报告</small></td><td>{{num(g.unknown_calls)}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
 <p>缓存命中输入属于输入 Token 的子集，不重复累加；缺失值保持未知。{{data.calls?'实际费用：未知，不能仅用 Token 小计当作账单。':'窗口内没有派发调用。'}}</p>
 <h3>模型用量</h3><p v-if="!data.models.length">此窗口暂无模型派发记录。</p><div v-else class="report-table"><table><thead><tr><th>模型</th><th>来源</th><th>派发次数</th><th>已知输入 / 输出 Token</th><th>用量不完整</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="(m,i) in data.models" :key="i"><td>{{m.name}}</td><td>{{names[m.provenance]}}</td><td>{{num(m.calls)}}</td><td>{{num(m.known_input_tokens)}} / {{num(m.known_output_tokens)}}</td><td>{{num(m.unknown_calls)}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
 <details><summary>每日用量与派发状态</summary><p v-if="!data.daily.length">此窗口暂无每日记录。</p><div v-else class="report-table"><table><thead><tr><th>日期（UTC）</th><th>来源</th><th>次数</th><th>已知输入</th><th>已知输出</th><th>用量不完整</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="(d,i) in data.daily" :key="i"><td>{{d.date}}</td><td>{{names[d.provenance]}}</td><td>{{num(d.calls)}}</td><td>{{num(d.known_input_tokens)}}</td><td>{{num(d.known_output_tokens)}}</td><td>{{num(d.unknown_calls)}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p v-for="s in data.statuses" :key="s.name">{{s.name}}：{{num(s.calls)}} 次</p></details>
 </template></template><p class="note">仅查询已有账本，不触发模型测试或付费调用；不读取密钥、提示词和回答正文。</p>
</section></template>
<style scoped>
.ai-report{color:#eee7f8}.ai-report header,.ai-report header div{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ai-report h2{font-size:19px;margin:0}.ai-report h3{font-size:16px;margin:24px 0 12px}.ai-report p{color:#c4bad3;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;max-width:85ch}.ai-report label{font-size:14px}.ai-report select,.ai-report button{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:#292037;border:1px solid #a78bc44d;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 12px}.ai-report button{cursor:pointer}.ai-report button:hover:not(:disabled){background:#3b2c4e}.ai-report button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}.report-table{overflow:auto;margin-top:16px;scrollbar-color:#6b527f #15101f}table{width:100%;min-width:790px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}caption{text-align:left;margin-bottom:12px;color:#d8c4ef}th,td{text-align:left;padding:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff18;vertical-align:top}thead th{color:#c4afd9;background:#191323}tbody th{font-weight:500}small{display:block;color:#bbadca;margin-top:5px;font-size:12px}details{margin-top:22px}summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;color:#d7c2ef}.ai-report .error{color:#ffb3c7}.ai-report .note{color:#b6a9c6}.ai-report :focus-visible{outline:2px solid #c7acf1;outline-offset:3px}
</style>
